ovato, CSB Campus Ministry Center","title":"Use the Trovato Center for a quiet group check-in","subtitle":"First floor, Donald E. Bain Campus Center","notes":"Stop by the lounge or interfaith prayer space to study with friends, talk with Campus Ministry, or take a quieter pause between commitments.","short_summary":"Campus Ministry gathering space with a lounge and interfaith room.","evidence_claim":"The Trovato Campus Ministry Center serves as a gathering place to lounge, study with friends, speak with a campus minister, or use its interfaith room.","source_url":"https://www.sjf.edu/student-life/campus-ministry/locations/","source_title":"Campus Ministry Locations | St. John Fisher University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"First floor of the Campus Center; the University describes Campus Ministry as welcoming students of all faith traditions.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
